---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Tracer Study Alumni — Program Studi Sistem Informasi"
  description="Sistem pelacakan jejak alumni (Tracer Study) Sistem Informasi Universitas Darwan Ali. Evaluasi masa tunggu kerja, relevansi kurikulum OBE, dan kuesioner resmi."
  lang="id"
>
  <section class="bg-navy-900 text-white border-b border-navy-800 py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-navy-950 border border-navy-800 text-xs font-semibold text-gold-300 mb-4">
          <span>Instrumen Penjaminan Mutu Lulusan</span>
          <span class="text-slate-600">·</span>
          <span>Tracer Study Resmi</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold font-editorial tracking-tight text-white mb-4">
          Tracer Study Sistem Informasi
        </h1>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          Survei pelacakan rekam jejak lulusan untuk mengukur masa tunggu kerja, keselarasan kompetensi lulusan dengan kebutuhan dunia kerja (DUDI), dan umpan balik penyempurnaan kurikulum Outcome-Based Education (OBE).
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 space-y-16">
    
    {/* Key Metrics */}
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      <div class="card-academic p-6 text-center">
        <span class="font-code text-3xl font-bold text-gold-600 block mb-1">&lt; 3.8</span>
        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-navy-900 uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1">Bulan</span>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Rata-rata masa tunggu lulusan memperoleh pekerjaan pertama.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card-academic p-6 text-center">
        <span class="font-code text-3xl font-bold text-gold-600 block mb-1">86.4%</span>
        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-navy-900 uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1">Kesesuaian Bidang</span>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Lulusan bekerja di sektor Teknologi Informasi & Komunikasi.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card-academic p-6 text-center">
        <span class="font-code text-3xl font-bold text-gold-600 block mb-1">92.5%</span>
        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-navy-900 uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1">Kepuasan Pengguna</span>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Mitra industri menilai kinerja dan integritas lulusan Sangat Baik.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card-academic p-6 text-center">
        <span class="font-code text-3xl font-bold text-gold-600 block mb-1">100%</span>
        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-navy-900 uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1">Berijazah Resmi</span>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Terdaftar di Pangkalan Data Pendidikan Tinggi (PDDIKTI).</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* Survey Form Card */}
    <section class="card-academic p-8 sm:p-12 border-slate-200">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center space-y-4">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto rounded-full bg-gold-50 border-2 border-gold-400 flex items-center justify-center text-gold-700">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-6 9l2 2 4-4" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy-900 font-editorial">
          Pengisian Kuesioner Tracer Study Alumni
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Mohon kesediaan alumni Sistem Informasi UNDA untuk meluangkan waktu 5–10 menit mengisi formulir tracer study. Data ini dijaga kerahasiaannya dan digunakan semata-mata untuk penjaminan mutu LAM INFOKOM.
        </p>

        <div class="pt-4 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
          <a
            href="https://univdarwanali.siakadcloud.com/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 rounded-md bg-gold-500 hover:bg-gold-600 text-white font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider shadow-sm transition-colors"
          >
            Buka Kuesioner Tracer Study Online ↗
          </a>
          <a
            href="mailto:sisteminformasi@unda.ac.id"
            class="inline-flex items-center px-5 py-3 rounded-md bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-navy-900 font-semibold text-xs transition-colors"
          >
            Hubungi Koordinator Alumni
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>
